          "text": "Talk to the Guard inside the gates.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "deja-vu",
      "title": "Déjà vu",
      "anchor": "Déjà_vu",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "deja-vu:1ko60sf",
          "html": "From the outside, <i>break</i> the eastern smashed window of the mansion (right click to choose break).",
          "text": "From the outside, break the eastern smashed window of the mansion (right click to choose break).",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "deja-vu:1ko60sf:at5iab",
              "html": "You might have to try again because of the dog",
              "text": "You might have to try again because of the dog",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "deja-vu:1iceltq",
          "html": "Once inside, go to the large room and take the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Scrap_paper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">scrap paper</a> next to the fireplace.",
          "text": "Once inside, go to the large room and take the scrap paper next to the fireplace.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "deja-vu:134oeyj",
          "html": "Go up to the 1<sup>st</sup> floor (UK) / 2<sup>nd</sup> floor (US).",
          "text": "Go up to the 1st floor (UK) / 2nd floor (US).",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "deja-vu:f2gg02",
          "html": "Take the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Address_form\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">address form</a> from the table in the central northern room and read it.",
          "text": "Take the address form from the table in the central northern room and read it.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "deja-vu:tf4h6w",
          "html": "Search the nearby bookcase for a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Black_knight_helm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">black knight helm</a>.",
          "text": "Search the nearby bookcase for a black knight helm.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "deja-vu:bqfn8w",
          "html": "Go back down the staircase and &quot;break&quot; the smashed window again to climb out.",
          "text": "Go back down the staircase and \"break\" the smashed window again to climb out.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "deja-vu:1obxqb1",
          "html": "Talk to the Guard three times. (you can click away after giving the items to skip the first 2 interactions)",
          "text": "Talk to the Guard three times. (you can click away after giving the items to skip the first 2 interactions)",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "I have proof that the Sinclairs have left."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "I have proof that links the Sinclairs to Camelot."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "I have proof of foul play."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
